<view class="page-shell"><text class="eyebrow">AVAILABILITY</text><text class="section-title title">每周可预约时间</text><view class="admin-card"><view class="admin-field"><text class="admin-label">星期（0 周日，1 周一）</text><input class="admin-input" type="number" value="{{weekday}}" data-field="weekday" bindinput="update"/></view><view class="admin-field"><text class="admin-label">开始小时</text><input class="admin-input" type="number" value="{{startHour}}" data-field="startHour" bindinput="update"/></view><view class="admin-field"><text class="admin-label">结束小时</text><input class="admin-input" type="number" value="{{endHour}}" data-field="endHour" bindinput="update"/></view><button class="admin-button" bindtap="saveRule">保存规则</button></view><view class="admin-card muted hint">临时休息、线下预约和手动占用可在档期日历中继续补充。</view></view>
